    "title": "Vote for Memphis boys high school athlete of the week from Dec. 15-20 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Van Tuyl ,\n3 days ago\nVoting is now open for The Commercial Appeal 's Memphis area boys high school athlete of the week from Dec. 15-20. The poll closes Dec. 25 at 4 p.m.\nNominees are: Andre Tyler (Millington), AJ Polk (Central), Elijah Lowe (Fayette-Ware), Eric Winston (Whitehaven) and Tyler Wilson (St. Benedict).\nVote for the Memphis area's boys high school athlete of the week from Dec. 15-20\nThis article originally appeared on Memphis Commercial Appeal: Vote for Memphis boys high school athlete of the week from Dec. 15-20",
